sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as Maintainer
    participant GH as GitHub
    participant O as Orchestrator job
    participant RA as Requirements agent
    participant J as Testability judge
    participant DI as Design + implementation agent
    participant TA as Testing agent
    participant S as Run state store
    participant R as Release job
    participant CI as CI
    participant RV as Review job
    participant RT as Route job

    M->>GH: label issue autose
    GH->>O: issue labeled
    O->>S: load run state (or create it with issue snapshot and test baseline)
    O->>O: choose start stage: restart stage, target stage, or last passed stage

    O->>RA: issue snapshot (untrusted), A1 skill, repo
    RA-->>O: spec with acceptance criteria and assumptions
    O->>O: G1 spec schema
    O->>J: acceptance criteria only
    J-->>O: testability verdict per criterion
    opt issue was vague
        O->>GH: comment listing assumptions
    end

    O->>DI: issue snapshot, spec, repo architecture guide, repo
    DI-->>O: design targets
    O->>O: G2 target check
    O->>DI: implement (same conversation)
    DI-->>O: code changes
    O->>O: G3 install, lint, scope

    O->>TA: phase 1: criteria, interface list, clean copy
    TA-->>O: acceptance tests
    O->>TA: phase 2: same tests on copy with implementation
    TA-->>O: setup fixes only
    O->>O: G4 tests vs baseline, criteria coverage
    Note over O,TA: G1, G2 fail: one re-ask. G3 fail: S3 max 2. G4 code fault: S3 max 2, then S2 once. G4 test fault: S4 once.
    O->>S: save stage outputs, last passed stage 4

    O->>R: start
    R->>R: secret scan, merge base branch
    R->>GH: push branch, open PR
    GH->>CI: run CI
    CI-->>R: green within 10 min
    R->>RV: start, with merge base

    RV->>RV: run tests in sandbox on PR commit only
    RV->>RV: reviewer agent: issue snapshot, PR diff, repo at PR head
    RV->>RV: G6 evidence check (fail: one re-ask)
    RV->>GH: review comment + label

    RV->>RT: start (always)
    RT->>S: read review round
    alt approved, or 2 rounds used
        RT->>S: mark done
        RT->>GH: comment: ready for human decision
        M->>GH: merge or close
    else changes requested, round < 2
        RT->>S: target stage = earliest classification, round + 1
        RT->>GH: dispatch new run
        Note over GH,O: new run resumes at target stage on same branch and PR
    else any job failed, timed out or cancelled
        RT->>S: record stopped job
        RT->>GH: update the one stop comment (redacted) with explanation
        Note over GH,O: re-trigger resumes at S4 after Release stop, re-releases for a new review after Review stop
    end
